            "notes": "The deck focuses on utilizing Brigid, Clachan's Heart as the commander in an aggro strategy. The deck includes a mix of ramp creatures like Arbor Elf and Birds of Paradise, along with various utility creatures like Mother of Runes and Stoneforge Mystic. The deck also includes cards like Swords to Plowshares for removal and cards like Birthing Pod and Eldritch Evolution for tutoring and creature toolbox options. The mana base includes fetch lands like Verdant Catacombs and Windswept Heath, along with dual lands like Temple Garden and Savannah. The goal of the deck is to efficiently ramp into threats, disrupt opponents with removal and control elements, and apply pressure to win the game quickly."
